# Date words that alone take a more frequent non-date sense. A preposition,
# demonstrative, number or year beside the word keeps the date sense.
# مهر: "kindness, mercy" and "seal, stamp"
# (Wiktionary "مهر", Persian, etymologies 2 and 3).
# تیر: "arrow, bullet" (Wiktionary "تیر", Persian, noun).
# The months take a number or a preposition: "۱۵ مهر", "در تیر".
مهر
تیر
